# Requirement Analysis Phase

## Project Title
**Pocket Smart AI: Your Smart Budget Recommendation Assistant**

---

## 1. Functional Requirements

### 1.1 User Account & Authentication
* **FR-1.1:** The system shall allow users to register, log in, and manage their profiles securely.
* **FR-1.2:** The system shall support multi-factor authentication (MFA) and secure session management.

### 1.2 Data Ingestion & Expense Management
* **FR-2.1:** Users shall be able to manually add, edit, and delete income and expense transactions.
* **FR-2.2:** The system shall support bulk transaction imports via standard formats (e.g., CSV, JSON).
* **FR-2.3:** The system shall automatically parse and categorize transactions using machine learning.

### 1.3 AI Budgeting & Recommendation Engine
* **FR-3.1:** The AI engine shall analyze historical spending patterns to calculate personalized monthly spending limits.
* **FR-3.2:** The system shall generate actionable financial nudges and savings suggestions tailored to user goals.
* **FR-3.3:** The system shall detect recurring subscriptions and flag anomalous spending or duplicate charges.

### 1.4 Dashboard & Visual Analytics
* **FR-4.1:** The system shall display a real-time dashboard summarizing total income, expenses, remaining budget, and savings targets.
* **FR-4.2:** Users shall be able to view interactive visual charts (e.g., category breakdowns, multi-month spending trends).

---

## 2. Non-Functional Requirements

### 2.1 Performance
* **NFR-1.1:** The application shall load the main dashboard within 2 seconds under normal network conditions.
* **NFR-1.2:** AI recommendation outputs shall process and render within 3 seconds of data updates.

### 2.2 Security & Data Privacy
* **NFR-2.1:** All user financial data must be encrypted at rest (e.g., AES-256) and in transit (e.g., TLS 1.3).
* **NFR-2.2:** The system must comply with data privacy standards (e.g., GDPR / CCPA guidelines for handling personal data).

### 2.3 Scalability & Reliability
* **NFR-3.1:** The system architecture must support concurrent user traffic through auto-scaling cloud backend services.
* **NFR-3.2:** The system shall maintain 99.5% operational uptime.

### 2.4 Usability & Accessibility
* **NFR-4.1:** The user interface must be responsive across web and mobile platforms.
* **NFR-4.2:** The design shall follow WCAG 2.1 AA accessibility guidelines for contrast and screen reader compatibility.

---

## 3. Hardware & Software Requirements

* **Software Stack:** Node.js / Python (FastAPI/Flask), React / Flutter, PostgreSQL / MongoDB, Python ML Libraries (Scikit-Learn, Pandas, OpenAI API).
* **Environment:** Cloud Server Environment (AWS / Google Cloud / Vercel), modern web browser (Chrome, Safari, Edge), or mobile OS (iOS / Android).
